.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-record-census 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-record\-census \- Record whether a landing was in flight when a container was replaced, and read the verdict back
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten record census\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record whether a landing was in flight when a container was replaced, and read the verdict back
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-record\-census\-note(1)
Append a landing\*(Aqs beat or its deliberate stop under this container\*(Aqs boot
.TP
batten\-record\-census\-record\-boot(1)
Record this container\*(Aqs boot, once
.TP
batten\-record\-census\-report(1)
Say whether a landing was in flight when the previous container was replaced
.TP
batten\-record\-census\-tally(1)
Count every recorded replacement by what it interrupted
.TP
batten\-record\-census\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
